{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.WedderburnUnconditional","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.WedderburnUnconditional","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.WedderburnConstruction","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRSKBurnside"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Wedderburn.wedderburnEmbedTotal_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Wedderburn.wedderburnEmbedTotal_injective","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/WedderburnUnconditional.lean#L79-L84","doc":"**Injective, unconditionally.** Positivity of `seminormalDim` is discharged\nhere rather than passed in — `seminormalDim_pos'` proves it outright, so nothing\nis left for a caller to supply. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Wedderburn.wedderburnEmbedTotal_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Wedderburn.wedderburnEmbedTotal_eq","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/WedderburnUnconditional.lean#L70-L77","doc":"It agrees with the conditional form, for any proof of the identity —\nproof irrelevance, recorded so a caller holding its own `RSKDimIdentity` term\nneed not wonder whether the two maps differ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Wedderburn.wedderburnEmbedTotal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Wedderburn.wedderburnEmbedTotal","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/WedderburnUnconditional.lean#L65-L68","doc":"**The Wedderburn embedding with no hypothesis.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Wedderburn.rskDimIdentity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Wedderburn.rskDimIdentity","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/WedderburnUnconditional.lean#L60-L63","doc":"**The RSK dimension identity, discharged.** `RSKDimIdentity n` unfolds to\n`QOU.Mathlib.RSKBurnsideHolds n`, which `rskBurnsideHolds` proves for every `n`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}